wip/py-espeakng-loader: Import py-espeakng-loader-0.2.4

Tells Python code where the eSpeak NG library and espeak-ng-data are.
The PyPI wheels bundle their own espeak-ng build and there is no
sdist, so build from the GitHub commit that bumped the version to
0.2.4 (plus the LICENSE file) and point the paths at audio/espeak-ng.
Needed by misaki (wip/py-misaki).
